<h1 data-copy-en="BR10DR" data-copy-zh="BR10DR">BR10DR</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Robot Bar presence and a one-time late event." data-copy-zh="机器人酒吧的在场时段与后期一次性事件。">Robot Bar presence and a one-time late event.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Info"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_BR10DR"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Scenes_at_the_Recharge_Station"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Relationship_Content"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: BR10DR — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/br10dr.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="BR10DR — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/br10dr.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>BR10DR — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>BR10DR is a current Robot Bar character with ambient dialogue and a late one-time event. There is no separate repeatable conversation menu, gift route, skill lesson or romance chain to grind.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Robot Bar: his normal portrait schedule covers all hours. The bar’s location services are separate from his portrait.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>After Story 100, return to the Robot Bar for his one-time event. It does not require raising his affection or advancing a separate Riki relationship threshold. Let the scene itself provide its context.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Use the normal location visit to see the available dialogue and event. No personal equipment reward or teaching service is attached to BR10DR’s current registration.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>An absent Talk button is expected. Repeated bar purchases do not open an authored BR10DR romance.</li><li>For the late event, confirm Story 100 completion in Objectives and revisit the Robot Bar.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">Future locations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Main Story navigation</a></li><li><a href="character-riki.html">Riki</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Info"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_BR10DR"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Scenes_at_the_Recharge_Station"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Relationship_Content"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：BR10DR 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/br10dr.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="BR10DR 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/br10dr.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>BR10DR 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>BR10DR 是机器人酒吧中的现有角色，提供环境对白及一个后期一次性事件。目前没有独立的重复交谈菜单、送礼路线、技能课程或恋爱路线。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>机器人酒吧：常规日程覆盖全天。酒吧本身的地点服务与他的肖像行动不同。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>完成主线 100 后，返回机器人酒吧可触发他的一次性事件，无需刷他的好感度，也没有额外的 Riki 关系门槛。剧情背景请在游戏中体验。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>正常到访地点即可查看可用对白与事件。BR10DR 当前没有个人装备奖励或教学服务。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>没有交谈按钮是当前设计；重复购买酒吧服务不会开启 BR10DR 恋爱路线。</li><li>若要触发后期事件，请先在目标中确认主线 100 已完成，再回访机器人酒吧。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">未来地点</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线导航</a></li><li><a href="character-riki.html">Riki</a></li></ul></section>
